e she will be fighting  from for most of the dance of the  dragons well that is until she takes the  iron throne for herself if even only for  a short amount of time  next we see daemon targaryen walking on  dragonstone with a dragon egg in his  hand right behind him is his mistress  massaria who also becomes the sort of  unofficial mistress of whispers for  rhaenyra targaryen  they're being followed by what looks  like several of the gold cloaks also  known as the city watch of king's  landing now for those of you who don't  know daemon targaryen was actually the  commander of the gold cloaks for roughly  a year he is actually the one who gave  them their golden cloaks which as we all  know is what they later became known for  now another interesting detail you might  not know is when daemon targaryen gets  massario pregnant with his child he  actually gave her his own dragon egg  however king viserys not only demanded  that he get the dragon egg back but he  also said that he should send masaria  away now in this scene it looks like  daemon is having a bit of a standoff  with who i believe is serato hightower  as well as several members of the  kingsguard and grand maester or wild  now for those of you that don't know  daemon and serrato hightower absolutely  hated each other in fact cerrado was  even one of the men who suggested that  king viserys name his daughter rhaenara  as his heir out of fear of daemon  getting the iron throne after he died  however this is just one of the many  reasons they did not like each other  then we see one of the dragons and their  rider flying over king's landing and i  must say this looks gorgeous in fact all  of these scenes look incredible the  cinematography is definitely on another  level in this new show you can see that  hbo spared no expense  now inside of the red keep in the great  hall we see king viserys targaryen as  well as hundreds of other lords and  ladies in attendance his daughter  rhaenyra targaryen is standing 