ice or an eye for an eye  let's say this will be just the  beginning of alison wanting rhaenara and  her son's dead now at the very end of  this new teaser trailer we get our money  shot when daemon targaryen goes and  visits his dragon as it unleashes its  scorching hot flame right in front of  him once again it looks amazing  if you don't know house of the dragon  will feature roughly 17 different  dragons during the course of its run  over a dozen more than we ever saw in  game of thrones not only that but we  will see these dragons fight and kill  each other and damn near every season of  this show now like i said at the  beginning of this video this new teaser  trailer absolutely blew me away it  greatly exceeded all of my expectations  everything looks and sounds so much  better than i could have imagined dare i  even say it looks even better than game  of thrones did now that's not to say the  story will be better than game of  thrones because i don't think it will  however i think it does look way better  than game of thrones very first season  as you all know hbo now has its black  belt in creating fantasy shows and that  is on full display in house of the  dragon now i know there are still a lot  of fans who are upset with how game of  thrones ended as i am but i don't see  how you can watch this new video and  still think house of the dragon will  suck  i think it's your loss if you don't at  least check out this show i know i  cannot wait for it to get released and  i'm assuming most of you watching this  video feel the exact same way now like i  said a minute ago i will be releasing a  lot more videos about this soon make  sure you subscribe now so you can see  them all right away  as always i want to thank everyone for  stopping by and watching this video i  hope all of you have a great day i will  see you again very soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  you

